{"id":"H0568","lemma":"אֲמַרְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"amaryah","sayIt":"a-mar-yah","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Amariah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.6.7;\nson of: Meraioth (H4812);\nfather of: Ahitub (H0285H)\n§ Amariah = \"Jehovah speaks\" or \"Yah(u) has promised\"\n1) Zadok's grandfather\n2) a head priest's son in Solomon's time\n3) a chief priest under Jehoshaphat\n4) Hezekiah's son, great-grandfather of Zephaniah\n5) a Levite in Ezra's time\n6) a Levite under Hezekiah\n7) a priest in Nehemiah's time","glosses":["amariah"],"count":14,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amariah","kjv":"Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amariah","kjv":"Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":52,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amariah","kjv":"Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amariah","kjv":"Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-24","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amariah","kjv":"Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-19","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amariah","kjv":"Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"2ch-31","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amariah","kjv":"Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-7","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Amariah","kjv":"of Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-10","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amariah","kjv":"Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"neh-10","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amariah","kjv":"Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"neh-11","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Amariah","kjv":"of Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"neh-12","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Amariah","kjv":"Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"neh-12","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Amariah","kjv":"of Amariah"}},{"chapterId":"zep-1","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Amariah","kjv":"of Amariah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 6:7","note":"Meraioth became the father of Amariah. Amariah became the father of Ahitub.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Chronicles 19:11","note":"Behold, Amariah the chief priest is over you in all matters of Yahweh; and Zebadiah the son of Ishmael, the ruler of the house of Judah, in all the king’s…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezra 7:3","note":"the son of Amariah, the son of Azariah, the son of Meraioth,","source":"web"},{"ref":"Nehemiah 10:3","note":"Pashhur, Amariah, Malchijah,","source":"web"},{"ref":"Zephaniah 1:1","note":"Yahweh’s word which came to Zephaniah, the son of Cushi, the son of Gedaliah, the son of Amariah, the son of Hezekiah, in the days of Josiah, the son of Amon…","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0285","lemma":"אֲחִיטוּב","transliteration":"achituv","gloss":"Ahitub"},{"id":"H4812","lemma":"מְרָיוֹת","transliteration":"meravot","gloss":"Meraioth"},{"id":"H5838","lemma":"עֲזַרְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"azaryah","gloss":"Azariah"},{"id":"H2275","lemma":"חֶבְרוֹן","transliteration":"chevron","gloss":"Hebron"},{"id":"H3404","lemma":"יְרִיָּהוּ","transliteration":"yeriyyah","gloss":"Jeriah"},{"id":"H3166","lemma":"יַחֲזִיאֵל","transliteration":"yachaziel","gloss":"Jahaziel"},{"id":"H3360","lemma":"יְקַמְעָם","transliteration":"yeqamam","gloss":"Jekameam"},{"id":"H8203","lemma":"שְׁפַטְיָהוּ","transliteration":"shephatyah","gloss":"Shephatiah"}],"senses":[{"id":"H0568H","gloss":"Amariah","relation":"H0568H ="},{"id":"H0568I","gloss":"Amariah","relation":"H0568I ="},{"id":"H0568J","gloss":"Amariah","relation":"H0568J ="},{"id":"H0568K","gloss":"Amariah","relation":"H0568K ="},{"id":"H0568L","gloss":"Amariah","relation":"H0568L ="},{"id":"H0568M","gloss":"Amariah","relation":"H0568M ="},{"id":"H0568N","gloss":"Amariah","relation":"H0568N ="},{"id":"H0568O","gloss":"Amariah","relation":"H0568O ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}